{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064508/block/singleImage/3271361/df/01M7QH223TS975NBPZY8FT7QZW.JPG?updatedAt=1795012316\"/><figcaption>APEC｜習近平、普京和特朗普首次同框，後兩者握手問好。(鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>中俄美領袖峰會明日(19日)舉行，在今晚(18日)APEC晚宴上，國家主席習近平、俄羅斯總統普京和美國總統特朗普首度同框亮相，特朗普與普京握手問好。特朗普與普京對上一次會面是2025年8月在阿拉斯加，預料在三方峰會上將討論烏克蘭戰爭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:04:08.460094+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:23:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:57:10.582821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:57:23.928855+00:00","content_hash":"22245d5da60e9f30ee71df69f7be95c57c1c67f71f8642888a4f8b59ac182642","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:04:08.460094+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}